{"_note":"首页管理区读取:关注列表(结构化对象数组)+ 当前 storefront + 预拼好的 ids 逗号串。与 apps-save.af 是一对:JS 改完整份传给 save 原样落盘(VParser 无数组增删原语,数组操作全在 H5 的 JS 里做,同 weather 城市管理页的分工)。","version":1,"actions":[{"id":"saved","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"apps","default":[]}},{"id":"sc","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"country","default":""}},{"id":"sids","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"ids","default":""}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"list","value":"${saved}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"cnd","value":"$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,if::(eq::(${@app.region},overseas),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)))]"},"_note":"国内默认判据(doc/overseas-first.md §1):没设过地区时,国内默认 CN、海外默认 US。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"country","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${sc},if::(eq::(${cnd},1),CN,US))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ids","value":"${sids}"}},{"action":"resultFilter","params":{"keys":["list","country","ids"]}}]}
